IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `pf75-nouns`
IMPORT `pf75-cross-references`

-- Row il-75. TESTS THAT PIN THE READINGS of the two items: the issue dates the footers print, the places each pointer names, the dates and the Hebrew forms of dates the pages print, the commencements as the pages print them, the subsection letters read, and both limbs.
-- These pass: they say what was read from what. The assertions that fail on purpose are in pf75-tests-red.l4.
-- The expected values are written from NOTES.md (the answer tables) and from the quotation lines, not copied from the values in pf75-cross-references.l4.

§ `Tests of the readings`

-- The issue dates the footers print. An issue date is NOT a commencement date.
#ASSERT `SH 2507`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 5 11 2015
#ASSERT `SH 2932`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 15 11 2021
#ASSERT `KT 10016`'s `its issue date` EQUALS Date 23 2 2022
#ASSERT `SH 2507`'s `its kind` EQUALS `Sefer HaChukim`
#ASSERT `KT 10016`'s `its kind` EQUALS `Kovetz HaTakanot`
#ASSERT `SH 2507`'s `its issue number` EQUALS 2507
#ASSERT `SH 2932`'s `its issue number` EQUALS 2932
#ASSERT `KT 10016`'s `its issue number` EQUALS 10016

-- The order of the instruments the two items rest on.
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 2932` `SH 2507`
#ASSERT `the first instrument was issued after the second` `KT 10016` `SH 2932`
#ASSERT NOT (`the first instrument was issued after the second` `SH 2507` `SH 2932`)
#ASSERT NOT (`the two instruments are the same issue` `SH 2507` `SH 2932`)

-- I1: what the pages print for item 13A and section 24A, and where.
#ASSERT `section 23 of SH 2507`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 26
#ASSERT `section 23 of SH 2507`'s `its number as printed` EQUALS 23
#ASSERT `section 11 of SH 2507`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 17
#ASSERT `section 11 of SH 2507`'s `its number as printed` EQUALS 11
#ASSERT `item 13A as printed in SH 2507`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 26
#ASSERT `item 13A as printed in SH 2507`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `item 13A of Part B of the First Schedule`
#ASSERT `the heading of section 24A as printed in SH 2507`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `section 24A`
#ASSERT `the printed text contains the words` `the heading of section 24A as printed in SH 2507` "הוראת שעה"
#ASSERT CONTAINS (`section 23 of SH 2507`'s `its words`) "בחלק ב׳"

-- I1: the insertion point of item 13A, and the places the two pointers name.
#ASSERT `the insertion point of item 13A` EQUALS "בחלק ב׳, אחרי פסקה (13)"
#ASSERT CONTAINS (`section 23 of SH 2507`'s `its words`) `the insertion point of item 13A`
#ASSERT `the first pointer of item 13A`'s `the place it names` EQUALS `paragraph 24A(bet)(8)`
#ASSERT `the second pointer of item 13A`'s `the place it names` EQUALS `paragraph 24B(alef)(11)`
#ASSERT `the first pointer of item 13A`'s `the place it names`'s `its paragraph` EQUALS JUST 8
#ASSERT `the second pointer of item 13A`'s `the place it names`'s `its paragraph` EQUALS JUST 11
#ASSERT `the two places are in the same section` (`the first pointer of item 13A`'s `the place it names`) `section 24A`
#ASSERT NOT (`the two places are in the same section` (`the second pointer of item 13A`'s `the place it names`) `section 24A`)

-- I1: the end date printed in subsection (He), with its Hebrew form as printed.
#ASSERT `the end date printed in 24A(he)`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS Date 31 3 2018
#ASSERT `the end date printed in 24A(he)`'s `its Hebrew form as printed` EQUALS "ט״ו בניסן התשע״ח"
#ASSERT `the end date printed in 24A(he)`'s `the section it ends` EQUALS `section 24A`
#ASSERT `the end date printed in 24A(he)`'s `the printed text that holds it`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 22

-- I1: the commencement as section 27(Bet) prints it, and the issue date as the footer prints it: two different values.
#ASSERT `the commencement of section 24A and of item 13A as worded in sections 11 and 23 of SH 2507`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS Date 1 4 2016
#ASSERT `the commencement of section 24A and of item 13A as worded in sections 11 and 23 of SH 2507`'s `its Hebrew form as printed` EQUALS "כ״ב באדר ב׳ התשע״ו"
#ASSERT `the commencement of section 24A and of item 13A as worded in sections 11 and 23 of SH 2507`'s `the provision that prints it`'s `its number as printed` EQUALS 27
#ASSERT `the commencement of section 24A and of item 13A as worded in sections 11 and 23 of SH 2507`'s `the provision that prints it`'s `its subsection` EQUALS JUST Bet
#ASSERT `the commencement of section 24A and of item 13A as worded in sections 11 and 23 of SH 2507`'s `the provision that prints it`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 27
#ASSERT NOT (`SH 2507`'s `its issue date` EQUALS `the commencement of section 24A and of item 13A as worded in sections 11 and 23 of SH 2507`'s `the date it prints`)

-- I1: both limbs, and how each was read.
#ASSERT `item I1: item 13A cites section 24A(bet)(8), and section 24A prints an end date in subsection (he)`'s `the item` EQUALS "I1"
#ASSERT `both limbs hold` `item I1: item 13A cites section 24A(bet)(8), and section 24A prints an end date in subsection (he)`
#ASSERT `item I1: item 13A cites section 24A(bet)(8), and section 24A prints an end date in subsection (he)`'s `limb (a) was read` EQUALS `official page image, with the consolidation agreeing (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY)`
#ASSERT `item I1: item 13A cites section 24A(bet)(8), and section 24A prints an end date in subsection (he)`'s `limb (b) was read` EQUALS `official page image, with the later instruments listed in NOTES.md`

-- I2: the definition, its date and its pointer.
#ASSERT `the definition of the determining date as printed in SH 2932`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 52
#ASSERT `the definition of the determining date as printed in SH 2932`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `section 34Bet`
#ASSERT `the date printed in the definition`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS Date 1 7 2022
#ASSERT `the date printed in the definition`'s `its Hebrew form as printed` EQUALS "ב׳ בתמוז התשפ״ב"
#ASSERT `the citation of 34Vav(dalet) in the definition`'s `its words as printed` EQUALS "34ו(ד)"
#ASSERT `the citation of 34Vav(dalet) in the definition`'s `the subsection letter it names` EQUALS Dalet
#ASSERT `the citation of 34Vav(dalet) in the definition`'s `the section it names` EQUALS `section 34Vav`
#ASSERT `the printed text contains the words` `the definition of the determining date as printed in SH 2932` "34ו(ד)"

-- I2: how the definition got there, as the page prints it.
#ASSERT `section 4 of SH 2932`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 51
#ASSERT `section 4 of SH 2932`'s `its number as printed` EQUALS 4

-- I2: the subsection letters section 34Vav prints, as read from the page images, and the section printed after it on its last page.
#ASSERT `section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`'s `the subsection letters it prints` EQUALS LIST Alef, Bet, Gimel
#ASSERT `section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`'s `the printed pages it is on` EQUALS LIST 56, 57
#ASSERT `section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`'s `the section printed after it on its last page` EQUALS `section 34Zayin`
#ASSERT elem Gimel (`section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`'s `the subsection letters it prints`)
#ASSERT NOT (elem Dalet (`section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`'s `the subsection letters it prints`))
#ASSERT NOT (`the section prints the letter the citation names` `the citation of 34Vav(dalet) in the definition` `section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`)

-- I2: subsection (Gimel) and its date.
#ASSERT `the date printed in subsection (gimel) of section 34Vav`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS Date 28 2 2022
#ASSERT `the date printed in subsection (gimel) of section 34Vav`'s `its Hebrew form as printed` EQUALS "כ״ז באדר א׳ התשפ״ב"
#ASSERT `subsection (gimel) of section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`'s `the place it is printed at` EQUALS `subsection 34Vav(gimel)`
#ASSERT `subsection (gimel) of section 34Vav as printed in SH 2932`'s `the printed page it is on` EQUALS 57

-- I2: the commencement of the instrument as section 31 prints it, and the issue date as the footer prints it: two different values.
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2932 as printed in its section 31`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS Date 1 1 2022
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2932 as printed in its section 31`'s `its Hebrew form as printed` EQUALS "כ״ח בטבת התשפ״ב"
#ASSERT `the commencement of SH 2932 as printed in its section 31`'s `the places it names` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT CONTAINS (`section 31 of SH 2932`'s `its words`) `the qualification section 31 of SH 2932 prints`
#ASSERT `the qualification section 31 of SH 2932 prints` EQUALS "אלא אם כן נקבע בו אחרת"
#ASSERT NOT (`SH 2932`'s `its issue date` EQUALS `the commencement of SH 2932 as printed in its section 31`'s `the date it prints`)

-- I2: the order, as a control: the power it names, the date it prints, the date printed under it, and the issue date of its issue.
#ASSERT `the citation of 34Vav(gimel) in the order`'s `the subsection letter it names` EQUALS Gimel
#ASSERT `the citation of 34Vav(gimel) in the order`'s `its words as printed` EQUALS "34ו(ג)"
#ASSERT `the citation of 34Vav(gimel) in the order`'s `the section it names` EQUALS `section 34Vav`
#ASSERT `the date printed in the order`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS Date 1 10 2022
#ASSERT `the date printed in the order`'s `its Hebrew form as printed` EQUALS "ו׳ בתשרי התשפ״ג"
#ASSERT `the date printed under the order`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS Date 21 2 2022
#ASSERT `the date printed under the order`'s `its Hebrew form as printed` EQUALS "כ׳ באדר א׳ התשפ״ב"
#ASSERT NOT (`the date printed under the order`'s `the date it prints` EQUALS `KT 10016`'s `its issue date`)
#ASSERT `the first date is earlier than the second` `the date printed under the order` `the date printed in the definition`

-- I2: both limbs, and how each was read.
#ASSERT `item I2: the definition cites section 34Vav(dalet), and section 34Vav prints the subsections Alef, Bet and Gimel`'s `the item` EQUALS "I2"
#ASSERT `both limbs hold` `item I2: the definition cites section 34Vav(dalet), and section 34Vav prints the subsections Alef, Bet and Gimel`
#ASSERT `item I2: the definition cites section 34Vav(dalet), and section 34Vav prints the subsections Alef, Bet and Gimel`'s `limb (a) was read` EQUALS `official page image, with the consolidation agreeing (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY)`
#ASSERT `item I2: the definition cites section 34Vav(dalet), and section 34Vav prints the subsections Alef, Bet and Gimel`'s `limb (b) was read` EQUALS `official page image, with the later instruments listed in NOTES.md`
